<title>USA: Allied Group boosts authorized shares.</title>
<headline>Allied Group boosts authorized shares.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES, Iowa 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allied Group Inc said on Tuesday that its shareholders authorized an increase in the number of shares to 80 million from 40 million.</p>
<p>At the company's annual meeting, stockholders also elected president and chief executive officer Douglas Andersen, Harold Carpenter, Charles Colby and Harold Evans to the board until 2000, the company said.</p>
